# Kustomize Practice Guide: ConfigMaps & Overlays (CKA / CKAD)

This directory contains a complete, self-contained Kustomize lab designed for hands-on practice with Kubernetes declarative configuration customization, overlays, and `configMapGenerator`.

Kustomize is natively integrated into `kubectl` (`kubectl kustomize` and `kubectl apply -k`). It allows you to customize raw, template-free YAML files for multiple environments without altering original base manifests.

---

## 1. Directory Structure

```text
/home/vagrant/cka/kustomize/
├── README.md                          # This practice guide
├── base/                              # Common baseline resources
│   ├── kustomization.yaml             # Base resource list
│   ├── configmap.yaml                 # Baseline application configuration
│   ├── deployment.yaml                # Workload referencing webapp-config
│   └── service.yaml                   # ClusterIP service exposing webapp
└── overlays/
    ├── development/                   # Development environment customizations
    │   ├── kustomization.yaml         # Dev overlay (merges config, adds namePrefix)
    │   └── dev-settings.properties    # File input for configMapGenerator
    └── production/                    # Production environment customizations
        ├── kustomization.yaml         # Prod overlay (sets namespace, adds replicas)
        └── replica-patch.yaml         # Strategic merge patch for HA & resources
```

---

## 2. Core Kustomize Concepts Illustrated

| Concept | File / Directive | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Base Resources** | `base/kustomization.yaml` | Declares raw YAML files (`resources: [...]`) shared across environments. |
| **Namespace Override** | `overlays/*/kustomization.yaml` | Sets `namespace: development` or `namespace: default` on all generated objects. |
| **Name Prefix** | `namePrefix: dev-` / `prod-` | Prefixes names of all resources to avoid collision across teams or stages. |
| **Common Labels** | `commonLabels: { ... }` | Injects metadata labels into all resources and pod template selectors. |
| **configMapGenerator** | `configMapGenerator: [...]` | Generates ConfigMaps from literals, key-value files, or merges with existing base configs. |
| **Merge Behavior** | `behavior: merge` | Overwrites existing keys and appends new keys into the base ConfigMap. |
| **Hash Suffix Control** | `disableNameSuffixHash: true` | Disables random content-hash suffix (e.g. `webapp-config-4k58m279b9`) for predictable drill names. |
| **Strategic Merge Patch** | `patches: [path: ...]` | Overlays changes (e.g. replica count, resources) directly into targeted resources. |
| **JSON 6902 Patch** | `patch: [- op: replace, ...]` | Precise JSON patch for specific attribute modification. |

